// The parts of an ABM page that are the same whoever it is for: the customer logo strip,
// the stats band, the industry section, the proof quotes and the resource cards.
//
// Kept apart from _abmRender.js, which lays the page out, and from the skill, which writes
// the account-specific half. Everything here is approved marketing content lifted from the
// template the design came from, so the page carries real customer logos and real figures
// rather than anything generated.
//
// The logos are inline SVG and the quote marks are data URIs, so a published page pulls in
// no third-party assets at render time and keeps working from a private bucket.

// Brands on the scrolling strip, as inline SVG.
